  "body": "The [hyperlink auditing section](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/0777f6ddda146ff7973b9fc1273d4c16ff92dc3b/#hyperlink-auditing) doesn't mention which HTTP `Content-Type` header to use for the pings. \r\n\r\nBoth [Firefox](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/311094ffb4500152544230378f6711d3598f1cb6/docshell/base/nsPingListener.cpp#206) and [Chromium](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/loader/ping_loader.cc;drc=6b30f9813451542424fb91d68f47f624e594aa38;l=272) seem to use \"`text/ping`\" (~~which [doesn't seem to be registered](https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xhtml#text)~~).\r\n\r\n",
